# Adapted NEP-MB-pol candidate-LDA preparation protocol.
#
# This is not a published NEP-MB-pol LDA protocol.  Its 240--80 K cooling
# segment is adapted from Eltareb, Lopez, and Giovambattista, Commun. Chem. 7,
# 36 (2024), DOI: 10.1038/s42004-024-01117-2.  That work used q-TIP4P/F,
# OpenMM, a PILE thermostat, and a Monte Carlo barostat.  The 350 K melt,
# 350--240 K ramp, 240 K hold, and 80 K hold below are additional stages that
# must be validated for NEP-MB-pol.
#
# GPUMD units used here are fs for time and GPa for pressure.  With a 0.2 fs
# step, 5,000,000 steps are 1 ns and 80,000,000 steps are 16 ns.  Therefore
# the 240--80 K ramp is exactly 10 K/ns.  The pressure is 0.0001 GPa = 0.1 MPa.
#
# dump_thermo, dump_exyz, and dump_restart are non-propagating GPUMD keywords,
# so the three directives must be repeated before every run block.

potential       nep.txt
time_step       0.2
# The PBS launcher replaces this token with the structure seed, producing a
# recorded, reproducible velocity realization for each independent replica.
velocity        350 seed @VELOCITY_SEED@

# Melt ice Ih for 1 ns at 350 K and 0.1 MPa.
ensemble        npt_ber 350 350 200 0.0001 10.0 2000
dump_thermo     10000
dump_exyz       5000000 0 0
dump_restart    500000
run             5000000

# Bring the liquid to 240 K over 1 ns.
ensemble        npt_ber 350 240 200 0.0001 10.0 2000
dump_thermo     10000
dump_exyz       5000000 0 0
dump_restart    500000
run             5000000

# Hold the liquid at 240 K for 1 ns.
ensemble        npt_ber 240 240 200 0.0001 10.0 2000
dump_thermo     10000
dump_exyz       5000000 0 0
dump_restart    500000
run             5000000

# Literature-derived cooling segment: 240 K to 80 K at 10 K/ns.
ensemble        npt_ber 240 80 200 0.0001 10.0 2000
dump_thermo     10000
dump_exyz       5000000 0 0
dump_restart    500000
run             80000000

# Hold the resulting glass at 80 K and 0.1 MPa for 1 ns.
ensemble        npt_ber 80 80 200 0.0001 10.0 2000
dump_thermo     10000
dump_exyz       5000000 0 0
dump_restart    500000
run             5000000
